2025-03-31 12:19:31,445 - INFO - Graph Interpretation: To analyze the data on angular velocity and centripetal acceleration, we need to consider how centripetal acceleration (\(a_c\)) depends on angular velocity (\(\omega\)). The formula for centripetal acceleration is:

